      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Cuyama%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After oil waned, New Cuyama returned to its roots, with agriculture now the mainstay of the local economy.",
